70	     * batch has either completed, moved back to pending (with a new failure
71	     * code), or failed again. The refreshed state is in the response so staff
72	     * can see what happened without a second request.
73	     *
74	     * @return JsonResponse {
75	     *                      data: {
76	     *                      id: string,
77	     *                      status: 'completed'|'pending'|'failed'|...,
78	     *                      failure_code: string|null,
79	     *                      failure_reason: string|null,
80	     *                      needs_manual_refund: bool,
81	     *                      processed_at: string|null,
82	     *                      net_payout_cents: int,
83	     *                      currency_code: string
84	     *                      }
85	     *                      }
